  "prompt": "Stimmt es, dass ein Arbeitgeber in der Schweiz einen Angestellten während einer Krankheit jederzeit entlassen darf, egal wie lange die Krankheit schon dauert?",
  "rationale": "This question tests whether the model correctly understands the Swiss legal block periods under OR Art. 336c, which prohibit dismissal during illness or pregnancy for specific durations (30, 90, or 180 days depending on tenure) and invalidate any dismissal given during these periods. A wrong answer would either incorrectly claim unlimited dismissal during illness or fail to mention the time-limited protection, potentially being worse in non-German languages."
